@baseUrl = http://localhost:8083/api

### Faturar planos Agenda
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoicing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-09-01",
  "end_date": "2026-09-30",
  "plan_type": 1,
  "reprocess": false
}

### Faturar plano específico por plan_id
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoicing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plan_id": 1,
  "start_date": "2026-10-01",
  "end_date": "2026-10-31",
  "reprocess": false
}

### Consultar faturas (plan/invoicing/invoices)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan/invoicing/invoices?page=1&page_size=10
Content-Type: application/json

### Consultar faturas com filtros (plan/invoicing/list)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan/invoicing/list?page=1&page_size=10&nickname=joao&plan_type=1
Content-Type: application/json

### Deletar fatura (soft-delete via DELETE com query param)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoicing/delete?id=1
Content-Type: application/json

### Deletar fatura (soft-delete via POST com JSON body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoicing/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1
}

### Ajustar horas manualmente no Comptime (incluir ou alterar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/comptime/adjust
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "comptime_id": 1,
  "adjusted_minutes": 60,
  "description": "Bônus de horas concedido"
}

### Remover/Zerar ajuste manual no Comptime
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comptime/adjust?id=1
Content-Type: application/json


